    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just so tiring. everything is just so heavy and meaningless now. if i stop pushing... if i just stop fighting... it feels like i'm just waiting for the end anyway. is it even worth trying to fix a body that's just a prison for someone who isn't there anymore?",
